tro-cid-wj3xakg6></div> <div class="space-y-2" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6> <div class="h-4 rounded bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6></div> <div class="h-4 rounded bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6></div> </div> <div class="h-20 rounded bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6></div> <div class="h-10 rounded bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Actual content container (initially empty) --> <div id="case-studies-content" class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-md md:max-w-none" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6> <div id="case-studies" class="grid gap-8 gap-y-16 md:grid-cols-3" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6> <article class="rounded-lg bg-base-50 shadow-md dark:bg-base-950" data-astro-cid-wj3xakg6="true" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <div class="relative" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <a href="/case-studies/united-states-us-semiconductor-projects-profiling" class="relative flex aspect-[2/1] max-h-[30rem] shrink-0 justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-t-md border border-base-300 sm:justify-normal dark:border-base-700" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <figure class="h-full w-full" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <img src="https://images.blackridgeresearch.com/zA7C1E09-z4Uj64Eb0zfkw/57972dc1-d898-4608-4264-c115b2373600/public" width="600" height="400" alt="How a Leading Industrial Solutions Provider Stayed Ahead in the U.S. Semiconductor Boom" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> </figure> </a> <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-base-100 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium dark:bg-base-900" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx="true" astro-icon="tabler/world"><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z"/><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0 9 9 0 0 0-18 0M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8"/><path d="M11.5 3a17 17 0 0 0 0 18M12.5 3a17 17 0 0 1 0 18"/></svg> <span data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx>Case_study</span> </div> </div> <div class="space-y-3 p-4" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <a href="/case-studies/united-states-us-semiconductor-projects-profiling" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> <h3 class="line-clamp-2 text-pretty text-lg font-bold" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx>How a Leading Industrial Solutions Provider Stayed Ahead in the U.S. Semiconductor Boom</h3> </a> <p id="descriptionText-united-states-us-semiconductor-projects-profiling" class="description line-clamp-3 text-pretty text-xs" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx> See how Blackridge&#39;s Global Project Tracker helped a global industrial solutions provider strengthen its semiconductor strategy with comprehensive project insights and verified stakeholder data. </p> <button id="seeMoreDescriptionBtn-united-states-us-semiconductor-projects-profiling" class="mt-1 text-xs text-blue-500 underline" data-astro-cid-f5ean2zx>
